    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features:",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Unique design ensuring comfortability, curvered round edges, polished surface providing you with reduced pressure.<\/p><p>✔ Easy to hold and use.<\/p><p>✔ Ergonomically designed with a  long handle that helps reduce gagging and allows for an easier and more effective cleaning experience.<\/p><p>✔Portable & Durable - it's perfect for both home & travel.<\/p><p>✔ Approved & Recommended by Dentists!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each package contains:<\/p><p>1x Portable Stainless Steel Case<\/p><p>1x Stainless Tongue Scraper<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "3442c9b0-dbb6-4dd7-b615-9313ba45f523": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions & Tips",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Here's to getting the most out of your Stainless Tongue Scraper<\/p><p>1. Moisten tongue with water or mouth wash.<\/p><p>2. <strong>Open your mouth.<\/strong>You'll want to open your mouth as wide as is comfortable, but not so wide that it causes discomfort. This makes your tongue more accessible and increases the ease of scraping.<\/p><p>3. Remove the residue generated from brushing, by scraping your tongue with the scraper. <\/p><p><\/p><p>4. Repeat this process until you notice residue from your tongue has been removed.<\/p><p><\/p><p>5. Rinse mouth to remove the loosened material leaving the tongue clean and fresh.<\/p><p>6. Clean the Tongue Scraper with water and store.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Do not force into tight spaces between teeth. <\/p><p>✔ Children require adult supervision.<\/p><p>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the electric dental cleaning kit?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Select your desired attachment based on your oral needs.<\/p><p>2. Turn on the device and alter between modes based on your cleaning needs.<\/p><p>3. Alter between heads if necessary.<\/p><p>4. Clean the device and the tip after use. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the refills be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, it can be used on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While it will not whiten these materials, it effectively helps to remove daily stains, similar to the performance of our Teeth Whitening Strips.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
